<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady/off $.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady/off $.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers sold steady to $.50 lower in a light test. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers - Few Choice 2-4, 1150-1300 lbs 61.50-63.00.</p>
<p>Few sales Select and Choice 2-3, 1000-1350 lbs 59.40-60.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers - Package Choice 2-4, 1094 lbs 61.20. ((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8723))</p>
</text>
